WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.390
<i>Previously on Phantom in the Twilight.</i>

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.420
Who are you?

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:09.650
You've been saved, human girl.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.610
You're Van Helsing.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.740
Yes, the 13th.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.590
Come alone.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.240
You must never return here.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.030
Forget everything about the incident.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:24.870
What is this?

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:32.210
<i>It's your turn, Count.</i>

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:50.520
I can't relax.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.180
Shinyao!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.490
Ton.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.850
It's so good to see you.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.160
You must've been worried.

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.610
Sorry.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.390
<b>
Episode 7 
Awakening of the Century</b>

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:49.490
Where are they?

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:51.980
They're nearby.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.400
I thought I'd kill you all together.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.440
Chinese martial arts, huh?

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:02.490
It's my own personal style.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:05.260
Martial arts were originally 
a product of wisdom,

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.910
developed so the weak could defend 
themselves against the strong.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.880
They're not something a creature as 
omnipotent as yourself should use.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.180
Unfortunately, I have many 
limitations and weaknesses.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.510
Let's go, Count.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:44.860
Be pierced by this cross and crumble to dust.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.350
How have you been?

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.290
Did anything bad happen to you?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.540
No.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.610
Since I was brought here, 
I've been treated courteously.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:00.840
The food's good and my bed's clean.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:02.510
And before that?

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.270
My meals and sleeping conditions were crude,

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.220
but he did his best to protect me.

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.060
So I felt safer then than I do now.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.430
Let's get out of here.

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.370
But Chris...

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.200
With him, of course.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.110
Let's all go back to Café Forbidden together.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.540
That's what's happening.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.300
Now take us to Chris.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:34.250
Operation Room, the target 
is saying she wants to leave.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.480
Unfortunately, we can't 
release you at this time.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.420
Please make yourselves at home here 
until the situation is resolved.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.890
What exactly does resolving 
the situation entail?

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:52.350
Why does this have to be so hard?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.520
Exterminating all the Umbra bothering you.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.060
No...

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.020
That's out of the question.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:03.370
Fine. We'll do it ourselves.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:06.100
They'll be exterminated soon.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.950
Just wait a while longer.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:11.290
Then we'll never be able to leave.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:15.040
After all, there's no way you'll beat them.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.510
There's no point in trying 
to force your way out.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.250
The door is locked.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.530
Is that so?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.000
Wayne, open the door.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.420
<i>Got it.</i>

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:23.960
What?

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.550
Shinyao, run!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:28.690
Stop!

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.570
Don't shoot! They're human!

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:32.600
Nicely done, Wayne.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.600
<i>See? Aren't you glad you didn't come alone?</i>

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.630
You make a great partner.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:41.400
Wayne, let's find Chris next.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:42.890
<i>How?</i>

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:46.760
First let's find a computer that will 
let you access their company's servers.

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.690
Then we'll do what we always do.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:56.790
I knew there was a ghost hiding somewhere!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:01.500
Sir, trouble at the office.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.990
Your underlings are demanding instructions.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.470
<i>Use your head!</i>

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.220
Isn't that your job?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.970
In that case, I'd wish you'd 
grant me more authority.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.060
I'm the boss! Don't defy me!

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.110
Do it yourself, then.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:28.060
No matter. I don't need his help.

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:29.840
This is already over.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.370
Did you receive a message from God?

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.920
You're still flapping your gums?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.930
What's wrong? You look anxious 
all of a sudden.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:47.050
Has your puppeteer abandoned you?

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.590
Puppeteer? What are you talking about?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.900
Your boss in the sky observing us,
analyzing the fight,

00:06:55.900 --> 00:07:00.350
and always providing you with 
the best strategies and weapons.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.670
You fought well.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:09.360
You used the knowledge of men 
to force us Umbra into a corner.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.360
But that knowledge isn't yours.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.620
It belongs to your boss.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.810
He's just my backup!

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.940
I'm the one who leads him! All of them!

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.250
I'm the boss!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:26.340
Van Helsing XIII, you're a puppet.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.430
It's sad.

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.970
Your predecessors are rolling
 in their graves.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:38.910
You monster!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.690
It wasn't working?

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.580
Don't you need a weapon?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:48.900
It seems your Santa Claus can't afford 
to send you any more presents from the sky.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.130
Backup, answer me!

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:53.540
Give the word!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.280
Defeat this monster!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:00.080
It's time to counterattack, boys.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.820
Jeez.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.500
I thought I was going to die.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.130
Umbra don't die.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:13.250
I mean the situation was that bad!
 Don't you get it?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:14.190
I see.

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:18.240
Anyway, did that old man 
think these wimpy guards

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:20.680
would be strong enough to hold us?

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:25.630
Helsing was strong, 
but his underlings aren't well trained.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.810
Yeah.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.290
What shall we do about Vlad?

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:34.850
Leave him. He'll be fine.

00:08:34.850 --> 00:08:36.300
I suppose you're right.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.330
Wayne, you're still not done?

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.030
<i>Give me a minute.</i>

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:50.460
<i>I'll show you the security camera feed.</i>

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.300
There, in the bottom left.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.090
<i>This is the fourth floor basement.</i>

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.210
Where are we right now?

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.110
<i>The 85th floor.</i>

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.930
Give me a break.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.790
<i>In any case, I'll figure out 
how we can get down.</i>

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.590
<i>I'm sure there are guards 
posted at the elevators.</i>

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.400
<i>Hey, Ton.</i>

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.540
We're near the building.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.110
Can we charge in through the front?

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.180
<i>Luke!</i>

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.950
<i>How convenient.</i>

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.960
<i>You were waiting for the 
right moment, weren't you?</i>

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.030
Wayne's with you?

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.270
Perfect. Use your power 
to find an entrance to—

00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:25.260
<i>I just sent you a map.</i>

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:28.570
<i>Come meet us on the 85th floor 
through the fourth floor basement.</i>

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:29.460
That was quick.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.960
<i>I sent the escape route 
to your phone too, miss.</i>

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.970
Got it. Wayne, come back to my phone.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.940
<i>Roger that. I'll—</i>

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.600
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:41.110
What's wrong, Wayne?

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:43.150
<i>I can't switch over.</i>

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:43.930
What?

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.390
<i>I can't escape from the server!</i>

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.500
You fell for it!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.070
I knew my antivirus program could do it!

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:54.050
Goodbye, ghost.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:57.700
I had fun playing tag with you.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.700
Wayne?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.270
No...

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.150
Is he dead?

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.080
He can't die.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.850
Wayne won't...

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.500
Umbra don't die.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.170
You're right.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.240
No one's going to die.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.840
It won't open!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.590
Let's run for it, Shinyao.

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.060
Pumpkin, you'll come with us, right?

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.200
Got it.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.790
Whoa!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.250
This way.

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.720
Ton, you...

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.730
Sorry. I've turned slightly supernatural 
since you've been gone.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.270
No matter what happens, you'll still be you.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.540
Shinyao.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:16.420
Besides, I seem to get along with Umbra.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.650
I'm not an Umbra!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.160
Hey, bro.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.370
Luke. How'd you make it 
past their surveillance?

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:32.560
Things are crazy upstairs.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:34.540
They don't have time to look down here.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.040
Look at you.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.110
You look totally destitute.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.060
Shut up.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:57.400
You can lose, but I never 
taught you to give up.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.540
Forget it.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.360
I don't expect to be saved.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.950
Aren't there people who'd 
be sad if you were gone?

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.050
Quite the opposite.

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:10.250
With me gone, she can 
go back to her old life.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.500
I don't count?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.970
Let's go, Chris.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:19.100
Don't you want to see her again and ask her?

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:19.960
Luke.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:22.130
Ask how Shinyao feels?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.140
If you have time to show off...

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.460
Take these off instead.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:39.790
You tried hard for someone 
abandoned by their boss.,

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.320
but you still can't win.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:50.540
After all, I'm the powerful creation 
of the fantastic human imagination.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.620
Kill me.

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.490
I don't have time for that right now.

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:57.500
You'll regret this!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.170
If you hate me, come for me again.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:07.590
But since you'll never harm a human, 
I'll never kill you.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.450
What?

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:32.540
This should stop them for a while.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:36.790
If we turn left and cut through another room,
 we'll be able to go downstairs.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.450
Ton, this way.

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:40.260
Ton?

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.510
Ton!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.020
I'm fine.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.820
Was that power...

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:47.840
It's okay.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.730
My great-grandmother will protect us.

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:56.210
<i>Captain, let us use our weapons!</i>

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.150
<i>We can't! Not against a human!</i>

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.950
<i>That's not human! It's an Umbra!</i>

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:06.080
If she's an Umbra, then it can't be helped.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.910
I guess I'll kill her!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.530
Wh-What was that?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:32.260
Wh-What...?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:35.680
Now you've done it.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.730
Who are you?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.480
You tried to erase Wayne.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.360
Do you want to die?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:43.770
The ghost?

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.670
He's trying to coexist with humans.

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:51.620
I erased his memory and went into hiding 
since he wouldn't want me around.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:54.200
No, you're not him... Who are you?

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.330
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.860
When I come out, humanity will be destroyed!

00:15:03.850 --> 00:15:05.500
A demon?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.060
This is not my problem.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:11.410
You can't blame me for whatever happens next!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:31.880
Ton.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:35.620
What is this?

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:40.460
That was close, Luke.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.210
Yeah, thanks!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.480
What was that for?

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.510
You hit me first!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.390
Run outside. Quickly.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.060
Ton. Ton!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:20.050
What? What happened?

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.220
What is this?

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.820
<i>I thought I was going to die.</i>

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.050
Wayne? You're okay?

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:32.920
<i>I finally got out!</i>

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.760
You suddenly stopped answering.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:40.040
I thought you were dead.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.300
<i>Miss...</i>

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:43.290
<i>Umbra don't die!</i>

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:47.100
Jeez! What have you been doing until now?

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:49.570
<i>I can't remember.</i>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:53.740
<i>It seems I managed to avoid 
destroying humanity.</i>

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.710
How can you joke at a time like this?

00:16:56.710 --> 00:17:00.330
<i>Our rescuers are here. 
I'm putting them through.</i>

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.620
<i>Are you okay? You're okay, Ton?</i>

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:04.850
We're okay.

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:09.090
Me and Shinyao and Pumpkin are all alive.

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.190
I see. That's good.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.580
They're okay.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.220
Here.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.140
Shinyao.

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.710
Chris!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:21.540
I'm glad you're okay.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.020
Unfortunately, so am I.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:26.990
I knew you'd be okay.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:30.980
What? Shinyao, what does that mean?

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.160
<i>I'll be right there.</i>

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.080
<i>Wait someplace safe for—</i>

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.720
It won't be that easy.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:41.020
Nice to meet you.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:43.200
Or is it the second time,

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:44.790
Miss Baileu Ton?

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.170
You...

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:51.610
Yes, I'm the man who kidnapped your friend

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.960
and tried to trap you.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.180
The mastermind.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.140
What?

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:02.140
While I do belong to Midnight Sun,

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:04.720
<i>unlike that simpleton</i>

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:09.030
<i>I don't object to harming people 
if it means achieving my goals.</i>

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.320
Haysin, you...!

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.650
<i>Run! You can't defeat him!</i>

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.030
Wait, Chris!

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.120
My phone!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.500
Ton! We have to run!

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.770
Go without me, Shinyao.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:33.900
I'll stop him.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:36.550
You've grown quite strong,

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.470
just as I desired.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.510
You're not making any sense!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.380
But you're still naive.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.440
It's that slasher.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.570
Jack the Ripper.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.530
Rise, my servant.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.240
Finish the job!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.600
No!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.170
Shinyao!

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:28.770
Chris!

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:48.120
Such fantastic power!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.680
You truly are the second coming of Rijan...

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:14.810
Ton.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:27.450
Shinyao, I'm glad you're alive.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.670
Why did you protect me?

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:36.670
Now you're going to disappear.

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:39.840
What can I do for you?

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:50.320
Is praying the only thing I can do for you?

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.510
Shinyao?

00:22:35.250 --> 00:23:32.090
<b>Phantom 
Twilight Plus</b>

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.710
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.130
Following the Twilights is the introduction 
of the members of Midnight Sun.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:46.970
I wasn't expecting us to 
appear in this corner.

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:49.030
Midnight Sun has a long history.

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:51.350
It's an organization with 
ancient and honorable origins

00:22:51.350 --> 00:22:53.140
that's been around for 
just over a hundred years.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:56.980
You seem determined to impress upon them 
that we were formed before the Twilights.

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:00.060
Since ancient times, we've sought 
the extermination of Umbra,

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:02.070
the monsters that would do people harm.

00:23:02.070 --> 00:23:06.320
How amusing that you've become a monster 
in your pursuit of defeating Umbra.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:10.780
Members are organized into colored ranks 
such as red, blue, or green.

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:13.810
We didn't hear about that in this episode.

00:23:13.810 --> 00:23:14.950
Was it cut for time?

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:18.140
I belong to the highest of these, 
the white rank,

00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:20.360
which has less than ten members!

00:23:20.360 --> 00:23:21.840
By the way, my color is—

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:23.000
You're black!

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:26.010
A stray mercenary with no pride!

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:29.880
Well, black can envelop 
everything in darkness.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.810
You've giving away the 
second half of the season.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:50.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.940
When Baileu Ton allows 
herself to lose control,

00:23:38.940 --> 00:23:42.300
she pays for it by losing 
her most important memories.

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:47.110
However, in some ways, 
she seems happy despite the loss.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.020
<b>
Episode 8 The Price of Power</b>

00:23:47.520 --> 00:23:49.620
Next time: The Price of Power.
